  "description": "Client API wire rules for the native card flow (backend mobile spec §3-§9, CONTRACT.md §16.3/§16.9). Errors map exactly like the web SDK: 401 -> UNAUTHORIZED (fatal), 404 -> SESSION_EXPIRED (fatal), 429 -> RATE_LIMITED (retried 3 times with 1 s, 2 s, 4 s backoff and the same idempotency key, then fatal), 400 with code 15400 -> INVALID_REQUEST, other 400 -> ORDER_NOT_PAYABLE, anything else that is not HTTP 2xx with code 00000 -> PAYMENT_FAILED. Network failures -> NETWORK_ERROR (a /pay is retried once with the same idempotency key). Status final set: APPROVED, PREAUTH_APPROVED, DECLINED, CANCELED, EXPIRED, PREAUTH_EXPIRED, REFUNDED, PARTIAL_REFUND, REVERSE; result groups as CONTRACT §8.2. Amounts compare numerically."
}
